[{"id": 68954, "title": "夜蝴蝶", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/b2ae09772490134547490f99657bd623.webp", "year": "2022", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "", "director": "霍埃尔·拉曼根", "content": "<p>尤奈丝又名月光蝴蝶，是安吉利斯、邦板牙省最炙手可热的女公关。她很快就学会了玩弄欲望和爱情的游戏，以便生存和养家糊口。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202401/01/kKsSNhAXbZ2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 68869, "title": "刹那所有", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/3aacadb3f148e0a6802b975a74696758.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "西班牙,智利", "actor": "Paco,Moyano,Manolo,Rodríguez,Francesc,Mulet", "director": "Alberto,Fuguet", "content": "<p>A film essay about a singular couple, Paco and Manolo, two Catalan photographers from the outskirts of Barcelona, who have been together for thirty years. Both have managed to work as a single photographer and have captured their imagery in the Kink magazine, a very personal photography fanzine with an essentially Mediterranean homoerotic aesthetic. Paco and Manolo’s style can ...</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202401/08/61Au8GcN2A1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 68599, "title": "甜蜜宝贝", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9fd28b3101b49639a3ba56472a38dc53.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "阿兹·阿科斯塔", "director": "", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \">本本分分在珠宝店上班的珍妮弗的生活一团糟——儿子体弱多病，丈夫嗜赌成性，直到有一天，曾经高中的好闺蜜瑞卡回来了，而陡然间变成大富婆的瑞卡出手极其阔绰，只因她认起了干爹，当起了包养妹，珍妮弗的三观开始受到冲击...</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202401/10/tM2cf2tikv1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 68142, "title": "味2021", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/8cefedf99ab157967d88e1cd8ecd4ee1.webp", "year": "2021", "area": "越南 / 新加坡 / 法国 / 泰国 /", "actor": "", "director": "黎豹", "content": "<p>越南导演Le Bao将执导首部剧情长片[尝](Taste，暂译)。影片讲述一名尼日利亚足球运动员在越南踢球养家，后来他的腿断了，不得不寻找其他收入来源。于是他前往一所废弃的房子，和四个中年女性朋友一起住了三天。Wild Bunch将本片描述为“具有毕赣和阿彼察邦·韦拉斯哈古的富有宗教幻觉的传统”。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202401/17/FGf6pyhUfK1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 68140, "title": "美丽的夏天", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e08f962276d07a0382a72ac33cfd1186.webp", "year": "2023", "area": "意大利", "actor": ",Yile,Yara,Vianello,Deva,Cassel,Nicolas,Maupas,Alessandro,Piavani,Adrien,Dewitte", "director": "", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: consolas, \">根据意大利知名作家切萨雷·帕韦泽（Cesare Pavese）的著作改编。20世纪30年代末，17 岁的吉妮娅（Ginia）在迈向成年的神秘旅程中经历了狂喜和动荡。与小镇的“知名”女性阿梅莉亚（Amelia）的相遇让她发现了新的自我——她不得不面对一种令她自己也感到震惊不已的、全新的情感，似乎只有承认这份情感，她才能成为一个更“完整”的自己。</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202401/17/vZLEfhDPSh1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 68138, "title": "四人行", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/ccfd3310f3b28ad9ad0269d28368bf6b.jpg", "year": "0", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>Vivamax crushes Robb Guinto and Armina Alegre star in this titillating romance drama about a married couple having troubles in bed, finding their sexual satisfaction outside their marriage.</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202401/17/EmEE7dquKk1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 67722, "title": "第34条法则", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/cd4c3f5c197bb0f477582f6cc06c363b.webp", "year": "2022", "area": "巴西,法国", "actor": "Sol,Miranda,Lucas,Andrade,Lorena,Comparato,Isabella,Mariotto,Dani,Ornellas,巴布·桑塔纳,马西奥·维托,MC,Carol,罗德里戈·博尔赞,西蒙娜·马泽尔,Lucas,Gouvêa,塞缪尔·托莱多,Marina,Merlino,Marcos", "director": "朱莉娅·穆拉特", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: consolas, \">白天是法律学院的未来律师，晚上是成人网站的色情主播。女主角用最原始的生命欲望表演出了最动人的女性主义：她反抗父权制、反抗女性压抑、反抗家庭暴力，却又渴望出卖身体、渴望追求极限、渴望被掌控。人可以同时害怕一样东西又渴望它吗？</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202401/25/3YBVSJ3ztU1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 67441, "title": "嘶嘶秘事", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/f2d00c70d2aeb5313fe4eece6719c0f1.webp", "year": "2023", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "安吉拉·莫雷纳", "director": "", "content": "<p>从乡下进城找工作却变成流浪汉的杰克差点落入监狱，好心的中尉将他捞了出来，并让他到一个退休的美国老兵家当男佣，美国老兵虽然阔绰，但脾气相当暴躁，他有着一个年轻的菲律宾妻子，不过很快杰克就发现，这位身居豪门的贵妇人却并不快乐...</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202401/01/vH7ii0wLpQ2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 66896, "title": "莉妮萨", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260708-1/fa6a14b178992897c04e440d7d226b18.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>当一位美丽的少女被冲上岸后，不幸开始在岛上发生。 她爱上了当地的一位渔夫，他最终在一次海上事故后失踪了。为了找到他，她付出了一切，甚至是自己的身体。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202402/08/kETrDUKFym3/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "HD", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202607/07/MkpuPbteaH92/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 66895, "title": "性游戏", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/601ebceada2566a95c637d8b25f30844.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "阿兹·阿科斯塔,Andrea,Suzette,乔尔·萨拉乔", "director": "", "content": "<p>有钱夫妇平时喜欢玩一些有关于性的游戏来增加他们的性生活乐趣。但当他们遇到另外一对比较保守的夫妻，则需要更加努力去制定新的性游戏规则，来取悦新的伴侣。简而言之，这对夫妇的性玩乐变得更具有挑战性了</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202402/08/7Nqb8J119b3/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 66894, "title": "伊娃", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/3894a3cb81de847b0943a46d23fb81db.jpg", "year": "0", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "", "director": "杰弗里·伊达尔戈", "content": "<p>当年轻女佣夏娃与一名男仆和她的女老板发生火热的三人行时，她意识到自己只能选择其中之一。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202402/08/6BS9Qv146Y3/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 66218, "title": "来来去去", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/d5a9eee72c29c6cf2308e12dbc038582.webp", "year": "2024", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "Denise,Esteban,Victor,Relosa,Aiko,Garcia", "director": "Roman,Perez,Jr.", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \">善良的埃德娜和丈夫拉里过着朴素的渔民生活，以打捞贻贝为生，某天，埃德娜发现了昏迷的可怜女人艾米，将她收留在自己家中，然而让埃德拉始料不及的是，自己的善意最终会酿成一场欲望驱使下的悲剧...</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202402/22/Z7Lbw9ETYM2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 65780, "title": "湖畔危情", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/710718eb00d74fb21e09ad00e8ce9003.webp", "year": "2023", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "Jela,Cuenca,Sean,De,Guzman,Josef,Elizalde", "director": "", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \">彼得在湖边拍摄情侣的性爱视频，并将其发布到网上赚钱，但当他偷拍米娅时，却意外目睹了她杀死了她的男友，但他对米娅心生爱慕，他又该何去何从呢？</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202402/29/XY2ebS9p2F2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 65777, "title": "情奋", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/428cd02b5405bb47585733fd86f28203.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "戴妮莎·加西亚,Rica,Gonzales,Richard,Solano", "director": "", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \">凯特琳母亲去世一年后，父亲塞拉芬有了个年轻貌美的新欢蕾莎，并且宣布即将结婚，诡计多端的蕾莎为了拿下塞拉芬的家产，不得不想方设法的让自己怀孕，不仅勾引了凯特琳的青梅竹马，甚至还看上了人送外号“大屌哥”的园丁...</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202402/29/v76RhGKQHp2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}, {"id": 65043, "title": "塔米的幻想", "category": "西方伦理", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e5c0382110f1fa3768425d55e1b0b425.webp", "year": "2024", "area": "菲律宾", "actor": "阿兹·阿科斯塔,Jiad,Arroyo,Ali,Asistio,埃里卡·巴拉格塔斯,Shiena,Yu,Zia,Zamora,PJ,Rosario", "director": "Easy,Ferrer", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \">对二次元异常沉迷的塔米本是个大宅女，虽然对性事充满着渴望却并没有体验过，在好姐妹的鼓吹之下参加了一次漫展并cosplay了喜欢的角色，在漫展上更是大放异彩，充满着“善意”的摄影师肯向塔米抛出橄榄枝，只需拍摄一些cosplay的香艳写真，就能获得不菲的报酬...</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD中字", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/10/8MKS1LLwhL2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_422d6b3d6a_part5.json"}]